                                "sense_id": "8e688022-588b-3a1c-9a7a-5ba399980cca",
                                "text": "A number of bishops cooperated with him , piqued that they had not been called to the ordination of Cæcilian . Seventy bishops , a number of whom had been traditors , met thus together at Carthage , to depose Cæcilian."
